  "title": "Lifeline",
  "briefing": "A Lattice survey convoy has to cross Frostline from the northern depot to the relay in the south-west, and the Crucible Wardens in the south-east will hunt it all the way. Vanguard rides with the convoy: you start with the escort and no factory. Foundry starts in the north-east with builders and extra metal: build fast and send what you make to the convoy road. Three of the six convoy trucks must reach the relay.",
