  "messages": [
    "Oversight online. Convoy is fuelling at the depot and moves out in two minutes. Vanguard, you are its guns. Foundry, get a factory running.",
    "Foundry: the convoy road runs down the west side. Rally your factory there.",
    "Convoy moving. First stop, the ridge south of the depot.",
    "Ridge reached. Trucks need forty seconds to cool their drives.",
    "Ambush from the east! They were waiting for us to stop.",
    "Convoy holding north of the Wardens' outpost. Clear those turrets off the road and it moves on.",
    "Anvils off the frozen lake, coming for the stalled convoy.",
    "Outpost down. The road south is open.",
    "Convoy rolling south. Last stop before the relay is the lake shore.",
    "We can't wait any longer. The convoy is running the outpost's guns!",
    "Lake shore. Thirty seconds, then the final run.",
    "Gunships inbound on the convoy. Flak!",
    "Wardens' main column is cutting across to the relay. Get there first!",
    "Foundry, raid coming up the east side for your base.",
    "Second raid on the Foundry.",
    "Third raid. They want the Foundry gone.",
    "The Wardens' base is rubble.",
    "Too many trucks lost. The survey cannot be completed.",
    "Convoy at the relay. The survey network is live. Well escorted."
  ],
  "objectives": [
    {
